{"articleNo":"540884","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=540884&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교내행사] 롯데웰푸드, 금오공대 공학제에 과자 후원","writer":"학생성공과","writeDate":"2025.10.23","hit":"2669","attachments":[{"name":"홍보 포스터.png","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=540884&attachNo=158308"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 data-start=\"175\" data-end=\"208\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></h2><h2 data-start=\"175\" data-end=\"208\" style=\"text-align: center;\">롯데웰푸드, 금오공대 공학제에 과자 후원&nbsp;</h2><div><br></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></div>\n<p data-start=\"210\" data-end=\"253\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>롯데웰푸드</b>에서 <strong data-start=\"218\" data-end=\"235\">국립금오공과대학교 <b>공학제</b>에 맛있는&nbsp;</strong><b>과자</b>를 후원해 주셨습니다!</p>\n<p data-start=\"336\" data-end=\"399\" style=\"text-align: center;\">주간에는 잔디광장 플리마켓 부스에서, 야간에는 무료주차장 야시장 부스에서 제공하오니&nbsp;</p><p data-start=\"336\" data-end=\"399\" style=\"text-align: center;\">학생 여러분들의 많은 관심과 참여 바랍니다.</p>\n<p data-start=\"401\" data-end=\"483\" style=\"text-align: center;\">또한, 이번 행사는&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"414\" data-end=\"432\">건축공학전공 김진우 교수님</strong>의 협조와 후원으로 이루어졌습니다.&nbsp;</p><p data-start=\"401\" data-end=\"483\" style=\"text-align: center;\">따뜻한 관심과 지원에 진심으로 감사드립니다.&nbsp;</p><p data-start=\"401\" data-end=\"483\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p data-start=\"401\" data-end=\"483\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmFYHoEYUhlAggTwKoCUBCAjAErzAN0IEkBZMgdQBkAvAORIDoAHAOwHMg%20\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\"></p><h3 data-start=\"519\" data-end=\"533\">&nbsp;</h3><h3 data-start=\"519\" data-end=\"533\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;[행사 안내]</h3><h3 data-start=\"519\" data-end=\"533\"><strong data-start=\"536\" data-end=\"543\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;일시 :</strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp;10월 28일(화) ~ 10월 30일(목) / 13:00~22:00</span></h3><h3 data-start=\"519\" data-end=\"533\"><strong data-start=\"586\" data-end=\"593\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;장소 :</strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp;(주간) 잔디광장 플리마켓 부스 / (야간) 무료주차장 야시장 부스&nbsp;</span></h3><h3 data-start=\"519\" data-end=\"533\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;* 소진 시 조기마감</span></h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
